Plate NEW-7: nothing recorded the app's version. Migration 235 adds
device_fingerprints.app_build; the fingerprint middleware keeps the build
code the app sends as X-App-Build (an absent header never wipes a known
one); GET /admin/app-builds counts people and devices per build over the
last seven days. The frontend has to send the header for it to fill.

